/*

Mental trigger

“Bit count DP → dp[i] = dp[i/2] + (i % 2).”


Time complexity

O(n)

Space complexity

O(n)



Simple intuition

Right shift removes the last bit

(i & 1) tells whether the last bit is 1

So number of 1s in i =
number of 1s in i >> 1 + last bit
*/
class Solution {
    public int[] countBits(int n) {
        int[] dp = new int[n+1];
        for(int i=1;i<=n;i++){
            dp[i] = (i&1)+dp[i>>1];
        }
        return dp;
    }
}
